[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2825.27, "timestamp": "00:47:05", "text": "但我跑得最远的路是冲击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2826.79, "timestamp": "00:47:06", "text": "回家的路，对吧？我不能视而不见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2829.109, "timestamp": "00:47:09", "text": "这种增长。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2833.589, "timestamp": "00:47:13", "text": "38 相同增长。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2845.43, "timestamp": "00:47:25", "text": "请参阅一份简短的参考资料。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2851.43, "timestamp": "00:47:31", "text": "我这里所有的屏幕截图都来自 Windows XP 系统。哦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2855.63, "timestamp": "00:47:35", "text": "呃，等等，Arisa，我想执行个任务。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2858.23, "timestamp": "00:47:38", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2861.03, "timestamp": "00:47:41", "text": "等等，她真的达到10000粉丝了吗？哦，等等，她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2864.15, "timestamp": "00:47:44", "text": "做过。但你知道案件编号是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2868.95, "timestamp": "00:47:48", "text": "关于龙和它，我还有更多了解。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2871.19, "timestamp": "00:47:51", "text": "有可能，但我正在用……制作内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2875.589, "timestamp": "00:47:55", "text": "我的大脑。所以我需要给对方一个惊喜"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2878.87, "timestamp": "00:47:58", "text": "垫脚石。第一步是"}]